# CSS

Brand tokens live in `:root` at the top of `style.css`. Use them; do not scatter hex values.

```css
--flyb-orange, --flyb-navy, --flyb-charcoal, --flyb-slate,
--flyb-mist, --flyb-warm-white, --flyb-white,
--flyb-font-body, --flyb-font-heading
```

- Child classes: `.flyb-*`. Override GP/core with existing selectors; keep new layout in `.flyb-*` blocks.
- Headings: Inter (`--flyb-font-heading`). Body: Frank Ruhl Libre (`--flyb-font-body`).
- Primary buttons: `.button` orange pill; do not style `.menu-toggle` as a CTA.
- After visual CSS changes, bump the `Version` in the theme header comment so `wp_enqueue_style` cache-busts.
- Nav collapse is 1024px (matches PHP GP filters). Keep homepage/grid breakpoints consistent with nearby rules in the same file.
